CORE
mixed.c
--sarif-result -
activate-multi-line-match
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
"propertyId": "main\.assertion\.1"
"propertyId": "main\.assertion\.2"
"kind": "fail"
"level": "error"
"kind": "pass"
"text": "assertion x >= 0 \(FAILURE\)"
"text": "assertion y == 1 \(SUCCESS\)"
--
"level": "(note|none|warning)"
--
Checks that --sarif-result - correctly reports mixed pass/fail results; only
the failure has a level.
